  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Resource and Support Hub for safeguarding against sexual exploitation, abuse and harassment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Resource and Support Hub (RSH) is an FCDO funded programme  to support organisations who deliver international aid to strengthen their safeguarding policy and practice against sexual exploitation and abuse, and sexual harassment (SEAH). The RSH is primarily intended to support smaller, local non-governmental organisations (NGOs) in developing countries and those operating in high risk environments who are least able to pay for this support themselves.</narrative>
  </description>
